    "en": {
      "name": "Ashtraya Mikumari-no-Mikoto",
      "effect": "1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuners\nIf this card is Special Summoned: You can send 1 \"Ashtra\" card from your Deck to the GY, and if you do, send 1 card on the field to the GY. You can only use this effect of \"Ashtraya Mikumari-no-Mikoto\" once per turn. If your opponent activates a monster effect (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 \"Ashtra\" Trap in your GY or banishment, or if there are 3 or more face-down cards on the field, you can target 1 Trap in your GY instead; Set it.",
      "official": false
    },
